meta {
  name: Update Tenant Branding (colour, font, mode)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/tenant/branding
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "preset": "emerald-fit",
    "font": "manrope",
    "default_mode": "light"
  }
}

docs {
  admin.branding.manage. The tenant admin's WHOLE remit: preset OR seed_hex, font and
  default_mode, plus color_overrides - see Update-Tenant-Branding-Colour-Roles.bru (and only while the theme is
  not locked: 403 BRANDING_THEME_LOCKED).
  The body is strict — images, product names, terms, nav_overrides and locale_config are
  Super Admin's, so sending any of them is a 422, and the database column GRANTs would
  refuse them anyway.
}
